{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/657607-wta-my-passion-and-my-first-post-hello","id":657607,"title":"WtA: My Passion, and my first post...hello","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-09-09T03:40:57-07:00","id":657607,"title":"WtA: My Passion, and my first post...hello","content":"*waves* Hello everyone<br /> I'm Brand new here, but been playing WtA for sooooo long. So long I dont even like to think about it. But I do like thinking, talking and playing the game!<br /> <br /> I ST a lot, a lot more than I play currently. That needs fixing <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I want MAW PLAY! Because of the love.<br /> <br /> TT and Forums, love em<br /> <br /> I love the duality of body and spirit. The setting, the horror, the moral choices and living to Glory, Honor and Wisdom. I love the Tribes and their place ordained by Gaia. I love the Auspices and the duties from Luna. I even love the breeds. (Yes even the filthy Metis)<br /> <br /> I love fighting Evil, as twisted concepts, insane forces, corrupted spirits and cleansing the blight of flesh. Yes I do.<br /> <br /> I love this game.<br /> <br /> but most of all, I like playing it with others. That hands down has to be my favourite part. Because without others I'm just thinking and talking about it. Which is great, and I enjoy that immensely but playing it, that's my passion.<br /> <br /> That's what brings me joy.<br /> So thanks to those who pour so much into into it.<br /> The creators, the supporters, and the players.<br /> <br /> so out of interest, what's your favourite part of the game?<br /> <br /> And anyone got any links to currently open forum games for Werewolf or changing breeds?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7706-somuchlove","name":"Somuchlove","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7706_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-10T01:21:50-07:00","id":659097,"title":"","content":"Welcome. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-10T01:29:36-07:00","id":659102,"title":"","content":"My first official welcome to my first post!<br /> <br /> Thank you so much! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7706-somuchlove","name":"Somuchlove","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7706_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-10T08:48:15-07:00","id":659410,"title":"","content":"Heya, welcome to the forums! :-) I'm more of a lurker here, but I'm really looking forward to your posts - it's always much fun to see content by people who love the game!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/593/w20supporterhiddengarou.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3312-taci","name":"Taci","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3312_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"63"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-10T09:10:51-07:00","id":659423,"title":"","content":"Heya Taci!<br /> <br /> And thank you, I do love the game. That might already be obvious <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7706-somuchlove","name":"Somuchlove","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7706_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-10T09:49:58-07:00","id":659459,"title":"","content":"Good to have new people- personally my favorite thing about werewolf is the use of personal might. Garou are very dangerous, capable of tearing apart just about anything; yet for all their physical might, it is still not enough to save Gaia from the complex and nefarious problems that constantly threaten her.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3695-the-laughing-stranger","name":"The Laughing Stranger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3695_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1010"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-10T10:34:37-07:00","id":659523,"title":"","content":"Hi The Laughing Stranger, thank you it's good to be here.<br /> <br /> I too enjoy the might of the Garou. As an idividual it's like 'wow look what I can do! Oh it's only a minor victory. But still...win!'<br /> But then as a pack it's like 'omg! Look what we just took down together! We are the greatest! Oh it's made a difference for a while...but still...win'<br /> Then 'look at what as a Sept we've accomplished together!! Holy Gaia!!!...hmm not likely we'll all see eye to eye long enough to be like this forever...but imagine what we could do if we all came together?!!! Why is every one always wrong about everything so much we thwart ourselves from doing this...ok pack...it's down to us. Hope I dont die...but if I do...I hope it's glorious!!'<br /> <br /> Of course, that could be just me <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> but yeah the complex things, the enigmas, the secrets and powers and the fact some enemies are concepts and entities claws and teeth will never be able to stop that make it all such a great threat to try and triumph...or fail trying to the 'right/might thing' <br /> <br /> And the moral dilemas that come with it <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7706-somuchlove","name":"Somuchlove","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7706_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"187"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}